WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.360
The memory palace is a technique

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.380
to remember facts, numbers or other things,

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.560
like a shopping list.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.000
It has been around since Ancient times

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.780
and is also known as the Method of Loci.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.700
Memory Champion Marwin Wallonius

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.340
used it to remember, in just 30 minutes,

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.540
the correct order of 5040 binary digits

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.980
or a complete deck of 52 cards in just 33 seconds.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.380
Here is how it works.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.400
Close your eyes and imagine some sort of familiar

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.560
physical space, like your house, school or office,

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.680
and then add a mental image of the thing

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.500
you want to remember.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.280
To remember a bunch of things

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.820
you can use different rooms

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.360
and visualize how you would walk through that space

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.740
following the same specific route.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.440
As you walk through,

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.060
place the things you want to remember

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:55.020
at specific locations.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:58.640
Ideally, imagining things in a funny or crazy way,

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.540
also helps to remember.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.880
Once we have placed

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.800
all items that we want to remember

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.440
our memory palace is complete.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.300
The day we return to our palace and

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.100
want to remember what's inside it,

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.740
we have to go back in.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.640
We have to concentrate and imagine opening the door

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.260
and walking our route.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.720
Once we pass by the specific location

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.840
that we used to place our things,

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:25.420
the item will pop back into our mind

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:27.940
Let's try to remember 7 ingredients

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.020
to make some pancakes.

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:36.320
1. You open the door and see a full cup of flour
next to some shoes.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:39.760
2. You walk into the bedroom.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.860
Inside your bed, sleeps a teaspoonful of baking powder.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:48.820
3. In the living room sits a massive egg watching TV.

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:52.900
4. And on top of the TV is a cup of milk,

00:01:54.240 --> 00:02:00.340
5. You go to into the kitchen and see 6 teaspoons
dancing around a bottle of vegetable oil.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:04.880
6. You leave the house and enter the garden.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.760
But it's full of sugar canes and in the middle,
a teaspoon dressed like a gardener.

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:14.380
7. You turn around to check the bathroom.

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:18.480
The only thing left is half a teaspoon and salt.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:21.640
Now try yourself!

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:25.540
Close your eyes and think of a familiar place
such as your home.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.380
We will now slowly list 7 numbers.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:33.760
As you walk through your space, place each
one in a different location.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.220
Lets go!

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:39.160
3,

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.940
14,

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.100
1,

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.880
5

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.720
9,

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:02.680
2,

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.240
6.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.320
Now revisit your palace then write in the comments below what you can remember.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:19.140
By the way, if you want to memorize Pi or something else for a longer time.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:22.640
Forget this technique
turn off your screen and start.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.860
Nothing beats are learning by doing.

